{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Take for me a heifer.</b> Etc. That is: if your children sin, I am revealing to you every kind of expiatory offering for every kind of transgression, and through this they will endure. And thus it is stated (Bereshit Rabbah 44:14): He said to him — through the atonement-offerings that I give to your children." "<b>A heifer of three years.</b> In its third year and robust, like עגלה שלישית, and as we learned: עגלה תלתא. Another interpretation: three years old."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:17.927021655Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}